{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep in an ever advancing computer, forgotten and unchanged, remains chess program Ver. 1. Peace is shattered by a software update! Can you stop the invading bytes before being overwritten?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hark at the minimal bauhaus graphics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Absorb the drone soundtrack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax in the warm hum of an old chess computer.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >24 levels spanning 4 worlds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 difficulty levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to pick up, difficult to master.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completionist, turn based puzzle gameplay.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How to play:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a mouse, touchscreen, controller or keyboard to control the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keyboard: WASD or Arrows to move, ENTER to select, DEL to open inventory</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller: Left stick to move, A to select, B to open inventory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562220/extras/39ad0a1e36c7692d9ce4bdd7ac2fdf01.poster.webp?t=1754624266\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562220/extras/39ad0a1e36c7692d9ce4bdd7ac2fdf01.webp?t=1754624266\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=370 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using traditional Chess moves, traverse levels. Opening item boxes, navigating traps, gates, doors, terrain and travelators.\u00a0Move carefully! Enemies can move like chess pieces too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once all levels (sectors) have been formatted, you can take on the boss! Defeat all 4 bosses to activate the final act.You will be graded after this, so work on your optimisation skills! Every level is free to improve upon during and after completing the game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562220/extras/521eaeeaf10d57273c3c78fe9500cd8d.avif?t=1754624266\" width=616 height=127 /></span>Pieces:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&lt;&lt;Pawn&gt;&gt;<br>Pawn can move 1 (or 2!) spaces forwards and attack 1 space diagonally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&lt;&lt;Knight&gt;&gt;<br>This noble fellow can jump in an L shape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&lt;&lt;Rook&gt;&gt;<br>Infinite moves along the vertical or horizontal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&lt;&lt;Bishop&gt;&gt;<br>Infinite moves along the diagonal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&lt;&lt;Queen&gt;&gt;<br>Infinite moves in any direction!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562220/extras/c894e5debaee786a14162674ab41644d.avif?t=1754624266\" width=616 height=127 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Example inventory items:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&lt;&lt;Health&gt;&gt;<br>Replenish your bytes with this bit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&lt;&lt;Buddy&gt;&gt;<br>invoke the power of un-deletion to bring a buddy into play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&lt;&lt;Muteki&gt;&gt;<br>Protect your bits for one round with this ancient routine of protection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&lt;&lt;X-copy&gt;&gt;<br>Duplicate your data, you're never alone with a clone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&lt;&lt;Decryption key&gt;&gt;<br>This 4-bit decryption key has the power to break any security.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And many more\u2026</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"100th take","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3562220/d83695701789d1de3df8f7fcff53e3ea4f8f2056.jpg"},{"name":"1st take","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3562220/74e03db698c6d47e0bfdc8667cd260f1e61d0a74.jpg"},{"name":"XP Level 3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3562220/92af7d70fd656ea35903c5bb2f5c33f4252f3e13.jpg"},{"name":"XP Level 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3562220/703aa701377a25323fe5f6a6997e1432c964fde7.jpg"},{"name":"XP Level 4","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3562220/1491a0fa69edd8e40580f81c845a5b7668adc609.jpg"},{"name":"Moves remain","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3562220/66dc856f7b866586f965e3c3756db7b9da9cabcc.jpg"},{"name":"100%","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3562220/05c4e75c8f8ea8c14543e1afe3960fe9f9313287.jpg"},{"name":"No moves","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3562220/a66a38de6189a93271fe2c15c43844cb0616e037.jpg"},{"name":"King Checkmate","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3562220/d8773ac8aea4f963be6d910e32aa40de55de590d.jpg"},{"name":"King Kill","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3562220/f69b484dd819924fb0da40b680fa989b9c251ee0.jpg"}],"total":26},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3562220?t=1754624266","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562220/f96c3b85b8ffdb12fa836088a88023d2b26b13e0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754624266","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562220/45c66533360db616cfbeb33bff7f11be94530def/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754624266","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai