r bits for one round with this ancient routine of protection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&lt;&lt;X-copy&gt;&gt;<br>Duplicate your data, you're never alone with a clone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&lt;&lt;Decryption key&gt;&gt;<br>This 4-bit decryption key has the power to break any security.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And many more\u2026</p>","developers":["Dadako"],"dlc":[3613210],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562220/4ad498be14e265283058e2fe274530f7f6f418b5/header.jpg?t=1754624266","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright 2020 - 2025 Dadako. All rights reserved. Questy chess logo and name are trademarks of Dadako.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64-bit Linux distribution<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core 2 Duo or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated Graphics (Intel HD 4000 or equivalent)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.12 (Sierra) or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core 2 Duo or Apple Silicon (M1/M2)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated Graphics (Intel HD 4000 or Apple GPU) or eGPU<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257173431,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257173431/movie480.mp4?t=1753370121","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257173431/movie_max.mp4?t=1753370121"